==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Cetoddle|53}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Icicle Missile''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Eiscue|44}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

